    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21622" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαργαίρω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γάργαρα</span>)
